[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19380.4, "timestamp": "05:23:00", "text": "满足他们的所有要求 以前的东西。我学会了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19382.798, "timestamp": "05:23:02", "text": "以前的东西。我学会了。 走最艰难的路。那太糟糕了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19391.43, "timestamp": "05:23:11", "text": "那会很疼。对不起。如果你曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19394.23, "timestamp": "05:23:14", "text": "经历这一切？是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19396.788, "timestamp": "05:23:16", "text": "是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19399.19, "timestamp": "05:23:19", "text": "至少就我而言，情况并非如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19403.43, "timestamp": "05:23:23", "text": "普通观众。但即便如此，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19405.11, "timestamp": "05:23:25", "text": "确实很疼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19406.43, "timestamp": "05:23:26", "text": "它仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19410.15, "timestamp": "05:23:30", "text": "疼。我当时就想，是啊，某种程度上是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19412.99, "timestamp": "05:23:32", "text": "那个人是个孩子。我认为是16岁或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19416.55, "timestamp": "05:23:36", "text": "某物。呃，住在阿联酋或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19418.708, "timestamp": "05:23:38", "text": "某物。我不知道。是的，我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19421.11, "timestamp": "05:23:41", "text": "明白小孩子喜欢这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19423.59, "timestamp": "05:23:43", "text": "但是，你什么时候才能长大呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19425.31, "timestamp": "05:23:45", "text": "向上？就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19433.51, "timestamp": "05:23:53", "text": "嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19436.47, "timestamp": "05:23:56", "text": "孩子嘛，总算像孩子了。是的。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19439.83, "timestamp": "05:23:59", "text": "那件事似乎一直没消失。"}]